                <pb facs="0435" n="369" sameAs="frus:frus1934v05/pg369"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">838.516/312: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Haiti</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Woodward</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Port-au-Prince</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-09-10T14:00:00-05:00">September 10, 1934—2
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 3 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>98. My telegram No. 97 September 7, 1 p.m. President Vincent has decided not to
                    send Blanchet an amended text for consideration at Wednesday meeting owing to
                    inability to obtain assurances from Senators as to desired modifications.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Woodward</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
